:"c-shiji-066-wu:m004-0107","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003815","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m004-0112","start":112,"end":113,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003813","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m004-0122","start":122,"end":123,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003813","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m004-0130","start":130,"end":132,"surface":"平王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003813","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m004-0135","start":135,"end":137,"surface":"伍奢","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003809","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m004-0144","start":144,"end":146,"surface":"奮揚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003819","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m004-0148","start":148,"end":150,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003814","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m004-0155","start":155,"end":157,"surface":"奮揚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003819","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m004-0157","start":157,"end":159,"surface":"使人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、官署借稱或未定指代，不補姓名或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m004-0161","start":161,"end":163,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003814","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m004-0165","start":165,"end":167,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003814","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m004-0176","start":176,"end":179,"surface":"太子建","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003814","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-066-wu","book_id":"b-shiji-066","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-066-wu"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:p005","text":"無忌言於平王曰：「伍奢有二子，皆賢，不誅且為楚憂。可以其父質而召之，不然且為楚患。」王使使謂伍奢曰：「能致汝二子則生，不能則死。」伍奢曰：「尚為人仁，呼必來。員為人剛戾忍訽，能成大事，彼見來之并禽，其勢必不來。」王不聽，使人召二子曰：「來，吾生汝父；不來，今殺奢也。」伍尚欲往，員曰：「楚之召我兄弟，非欲以生我父也，恐有脫者後生患，故以父為質，詐召二子。二子到，則父子俱死。何益父之死？往而令讎不得報耳。不如奔他國，借力以雪父之恥，俱滅，無為也。」伍尚曰：「我知往終不能全父命。然恨父召我以求生而不往，後不能雪恥，終為天下笑耳。」謂員：「可去矣！汝能報殺父之讎，我將歸死。」尚既就執，使者捕伍胥。伍胥貫弓執矢向使者，使者不敢進，伍胥遂亡。聞太子建之在宋，往從之。奢聞子胥之亡也，曰：「楚國君臣且苦兵矣。」伍尚至楚，楚并殺奢與尚也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m005-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"無忌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003815","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m005-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"平王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003813","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m005-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"伍奢","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003809","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m005-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"二子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、官署借稱或未定指代，不補姓名或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m005-0042","start":42,"end":43,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003813","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m005-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"伍奢","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003809","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m005-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"二子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者、官署借稱或未定指代，不補姓名或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m005-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"伍奢","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003809","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m005-0070","start":70,"end":71,"surface":"尚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003810","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m005-0079","start":79,"end":80,"surface":"員","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003808","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-066-wu:m005-0106","start":106,"end":107,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003813","status":"contextual_provisional"},